03e\u003cp\u003e林尼：哈哈…不然下次，我戴着兽耳试试？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：……\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：可以，我明天就去告诉父亲大人你的要求。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：父亲大人也在挪德卡莱戴过兽耳头箍，她会理解的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e林尼：…你怎么一下子来劲了，琳妮特？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e琳妮特：哥哥的愿望，我一定会满足的。毕竟，我是哥哥最好的妹妹。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e林尼：你绝对是来劲了吧！\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}},\"root_id\":\"p3onuh9rqzT1791006244192\"}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"10887","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"8176","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"逸闻纪事·二","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"名称\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e林尼·表演场所\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"简介\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e在剧院里，你遇见了正在讨论表演问题的林尼和琳妮特，他们好像正在讨论和魔术表演有关的问题…？\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关奖励\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e每累计获得10条任意角色的逸闻纪事，即可获得一次奖励：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5566\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/08/160182379/f9de059da2ee541c770eb1c83d0018a9_6412355601661015430.jpg\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"原石\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"50\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e原石\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*50\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"备注\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e隐藏（概率刷出，位于剧院内售票处）\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"10889",